      \field{abstract}{The Synthesis Report ({SYR}) is a stand-alone synthesis of the most policy-relevant evidence from the scientific, technical, and socio-economic literature assessed in the Sixth Assessment Report ({AR}6) of the Intergovernmental Panel on Climate Change ({IPCC}). The {SYR} distils and integrates the main findings of the three reports of the Working Groups of the {IPCC} during the {AR}6, and the three {AR}6 Special Reports into a concise document. It consists of a Summary for Policymakers and a longer report.}
